    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/7/87003.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 80,
    "turn_text": "Well, but beyond that, Where the hell have you been the last couple of years? You know, you get a few thousand to come in on buses and you lose your mind. Would you like to see what's happening? It's just it once again demonstrates the incredible arrogance of national media. And the fact of the matter is these big city folks who think we're flyover country.",
